---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro'
---

<Page
  title="About"
  description="About Alpisto d.o.o. — a small engineering practice in Slovenia, and Evgeny Istomin, the engineer behind it."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">

    <!-- About the company -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">About</h1>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Alpisto d.o.o.</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Alpisto d.o.o. is a Slovenian engineering company founded in Tolmin. We operate as
          a boutique consulting practice focused on R&D engineering problems — specifically the
          kind that sit at the boundary between scientific computing and production software.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our business model is simple: project-based engagements billed in EUR, plus our own
          hardware product line, <a href="https://market.flybeeper.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FlyBeeper</a> (BLE variometers and flight computers for
          paragliding pilots). Building FlyBeeper end-to-end — from nRF52 firmware to FastAPI
          backends to the web shop — keeps our production skills sharp.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are EU VAT registered (SI91102227) and invoice in EUR. We work with teams across
          Europe and beyond on remote engagements.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About the engineer -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Evgeny Istomin — the engineer</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          20+ years in electrical power systems engineering, followed by a deliberate move
          into software. I've worked on state estimation, OPF, and protection relay logic in
          legacy MATLAB and C++ codebases — and I've been on the other side, migrating those
          systems to Python.
        </p>
        <p>
          Since 2020, my stack has expanded to embedded firmware (ESP32, nRF52, Zephyr RTOS),
          event-driven backends (FastAPI, NATS, MQTT), scientific Python (NumPy, SciPy,
          pandapower), and BLE sensor fusion. All of this runs in FlyBeeper, which ships to
          real customers.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm based in Slovenia. I work in English and Slovenian. I take on a small number
          of consulting clients at a time to keep quality high.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Genajoin"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-900 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors"
        >
          GitHub: Genajoin
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/evgenyistomin"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-900 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a
          href="/blog"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-900 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors"
        >
          Blog
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Working principles -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">How we work</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        {[
          'We work hands-on. No PowerPoint consulting, no offshore handoffs.',
          'We ship working code — tests, CI, documentation if the scope calls for it.',
          'We prefer short paid engagements that prove fit before scaling up.',
          'We respect NDAs, IP boundaries, and your existing team dynamics.',
          'If we can\'t help, we\'ll tell you so instead of taking the money.',
        ].map(principle => (
          <li class="flex gap-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">—</span>
            <span>{principle}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Get in touch</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
        The best way to start is a short email describing the problem. No RFPs, no NDAs before
        hello.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="mailto:info@alpisto.eu"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors"
        >
          info@alpisto.eu
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/evgenyistomin"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-900 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Page>
